{"id":261,"flavor":[{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Sapphire"],"text":"Poochyena is an omnivore—it will eat anything. A distinguishing feature is how large its fangs are compared to its body. This Pokémon tries to intimidate its foes by making the hair on its tail bristle out."},{"games":["Omega Ruby","Ruby"],"text":"At first sight, Poochyena takes a bite at anything that moves. This Pokémon chases after prey until the victim becomes exhausted. However, it may turn tail if the prey strikes back."},{"games":["Y","LeafGreen","FireRed"],"text":"It has a very tenacious nature. Its acute sense of smell lets it chase a chosen prey without ever losing track."},{"games":["X","White 2","Black 2","White","Black","Platinum","Pearl","Diamond"],"text":"A Pokémon with a persistent nature, it chases its chosen prey until the prey becomes exhausted."},{"games":["SoulSilver","HeartGold"],"text":"It chases its prey until the victim becomes exhausted. However, it turns tail if the prey strikes back."},{"games":["Emerald"],"text":"It savagely threatens foes with bared fangs. It chases after fleeing targets tenaciously. It turns tail and runs, however, if the foe strikes back."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Run Away","hidden":false,"description":"Enables a sure getaway from wild Pokémon."},{"name":"Quick Feet","hidden":false,"description":"Boosts the Speed stat if the Pokémon has a status condition."},{"name":"Rattled","hidden":true,"description":"The Pokémon gets scared when hit by a Dark-, Ghost-, or Bug-type attack or if intimidated, which boosts its Speed stat."}],"eggGroups":["Field"],"genderRate":4,"hatchCounter":15,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"medium","habitat":"grassland","color":"Gray","shape":"Quadruped","evolution":{"id":261,"name":"Poochyena","condition":null,"children":[{"id":262,"name":"Mightyena","condition":"Lv. 18","children":[]}]},"moves":{"game":"Scarlet / Violet","level":[[1,33],[4,336],[7,28],[10,44],[13,43],[16,46],[19,207],[22,372],[25,184],[28,269],[31,242],[34,281],[36,36],[40,389],[44,583]],"machine":[204,242,399,91,38,283,203,263,424,492,270,304,423,808,189,417,583,182,706,240,156,46,184,247,214,555,180,164,241,162,36,269,851,168,422,885,253],"egg":[310,343,305],"tutor":[]},"cards":[{"id":"me2pt5-128","name":"Poochyena","set":"Ascended Heroes","date":"2026-01-30","rarity":"Common","number":"128","artist":"Miki Tanaka","small":"https://images.scrydex.com/pokemon/me2pt5-128/small","large":"https://images.scrydex.com/pokemon/me2pt5-128/large"},{"id":"sv6-113","name":"Poochyena","set":"Twilight Masquerade","date":"2024-05-24","rarity":"Common","number":"113","artist":"Shibuzoh.","img":"sv6/113"},{"id":"sv5-105","name":"Poochyena","set":"Temporal Forces","date":"2024-03-22","rarity":"Common","number":"105","artist":"Miki Tanaka","img":"sv5/105"},{"id":"swsh12pt5gg-GG33","name":"Poochyena","set":"Crown Zenith Galarian Gallery","date":"2023-01-20","rarity":"Trainer Gallery Rare Holo","number":"GG33","artist":"Kouki Saitou","img":"swsh12pt5gg/GG33"},{"id":"swsh10-95","name":"Poochyena","set":"Astral Radiance","date":"2022-05-27","rarity":"Common","number":"95","artist":"KIYOTAKA OSHIYAMA","img":"swsh10/95"},{"id":"swsh4-103","name":"Poochyena","set":"Vivid Voltage","date":"2020-11-13","rarity":"Common","number":"103","artist":"ryoma uratsuka","img":"swsh4/103"},{"id":"sm9-86","name":"Poochyena","set":"Team Up","date":"2019-02-01","rarity":"Common","number":"86","artist":"Ken Sugimori","img":"sm9/86"},{"id":"dc1-16","name":"Team Aqua's Poochyena","set":"Double Crisis","date":"2015-03-25","rarity":"Common","number":"16","artist":"Kouki Saitou","img":"dc1/16"},{"id":"dc1-17","name":"Team Magma's Poochyena","set":"Double Crisis","date":"2015-03-25","rarity":"Common","number":"17","artist":"TOKIYA","img":"dc1/17"},{"id":"xy4-53","name":"Poochyena","set":"Phantom Forces","date":"2014-11-05","rarity":"Common","number":"53","artist":"5ban Graphics","img":"xy4/53"},{"id":"xy0-16","name":"Poochyena","set":"Kalos Starter Set","date":"2013-11-08"